{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2023-03-13 09:00:00', 'title': "ADM NAMED TO WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES LIST FOR FOURTH YEAR IN A ROW", 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ADM (NYSE: ADM) HAS AGAIN BEEN RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES BY ETHISPHERE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES. THIS MARKS THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR ADM HAS RECEIVED THIS RECOGNITION, WHICH HONORS COMPANIES WHO UNDERSTAND THE IMPORTANCE OF LEADING, PRIORITIZE ETHICAL BUSINESS PERFORMANCE, AND HAVE DEMONSTRATED AN OVERALL COMMITMENT TO INTEGRITY."}